{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As a term of a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnyOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of component types matches the entities that hold at least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one of the types, and reads a tuple with one optional per type: the entity’s component, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" where the entity lacks that type. Use it to visit entities that may carry any of several","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"related components:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"frozen comet\"), Velocity(dx: 4, dy: 0), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"), Velocity(dx: 2, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"ice\"), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","var descriptions: [String] = []","for (_, name, (velocity, frozen)) in world.query(Query(Name.self, AnyOf<Velocity, Frozen>.self)) {","    let state = frozen == nil ? \"moving at \\(velocity?.dx ?? 0)\" : \"frozen\"","    descriptions.append(\"\\(name.value) is \\(state)\")","}","print(descriptions)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"frozen comet is frozen\", \"comet is moving at 2.0\", \"ice is frozen\"]\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The rock holds neither type, so the query skips it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As a filter type of a system’s query ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"code":"AnyOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of filter types passes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entities that pass at least one of them: "},{"code":"Query<Health>.Where<AnyOf<Changed<Health>, Without<Frozen>>>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" visits the entities whose health changed and the ones that aren’t frozen.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Queries of one to three terms, with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnyOf"},{"type":"text","text":" groups of two to four types, run through code"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specialized for their exact shape."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/anyof"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","title":"AnyOf","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule5AnyOfV","remoteS